Subject: Add Intl, WebAssembly, sensors, window ctors, IntersectionObserver
 overrides (Batch 18: 30 APIs)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Intl: DateTimeFormat.resolvedOptions, NumberFormat + RelativeTimeFormat ctors.
WebAssembly: compile, instantiate, validate, compileStreaming, instantiateStreaming.
Sensors: Accelerometer, LinearAccelerationSensor, GravitySensor, Gyroscope,
Magnetometer, AbsoluteOrientationSensor, RelativeOrientationSensor,
AmbientLightSensor constructors.
Window ctors: PointerEvent, Worker, SharedWorker, MessageChannel,
BroadcastChannel, SpeechSynthesisUtterance, RTCPeerConnection,
webkitRTCPeerConnection, IntersectionObserver, PerformanceObserver.
IntersectionObserver prototype: observe, unobserve, disconnect, takeRecords.

All Pattern V/X in v8_builtin_overrides.cc — no IDL changes needed.
New install functions: InstallIntlOverrides, InstallWebAssemblyOverrides,
InstallSensorOverrides, InstallIntersectionObserverOverrides.
Expanded InstallConstructorOverrides kCtors table with 9 new entries.

